000100*================================================================*
000200* PROGRAM    : CMB010                                            *
000300* TITLE      : OPEN BUSINESS DAY - ROLL THE DATE CARD            *
000400* SYSTEM     : MERIDIAN EOD - COMMON SERVICES (CM)               *
000500* JOB        : MSCMD010  (FIRST JOB OF THE EOD CYCLE)            *
000600*----------------------------------------------------------------*
000700* DESCRIPTION:                                                   *
000800*   READS YESTERDAY'S DATE CARD, ROLLS THE BUSINESS DATE TO THE  *
000900*   NEXT BUSINESS DAY ON THE NYSE CALENDAR (CMU010), SETS THE    *
001000*   CYCLE TYPE (D DAILY, M MONTH END, Q QUARTER END, Y YEAR END  *
001100*   - SET ON THE LAST BUSINESS DAY OF THE PERIOD) AND WRITES THE *
001200*   NEW DATE CARD USED BY EVERY PROGRAM IN THE CYCLE.            *
001300*                                                                *
001400*   OPTIONAL CONTROL CARDS ON SYSIN (COLUMN 1):                  *
001500*     BUSDATE=CCYYMMDD   FORCE THE BUSINESS DATE (RECOVERY ONLY) *
001600*     RERUN=Y            RE-OPEN THE SAME BUSINESS DATE AGAIN    *
001700*     REGION=XXXX        CYCLE REGION (DEFAULT CARRIED FORWARD)  *
001800*     * IN COLUMN 1      COMMENT                                 *
001900*   A MISSING OR DUMMY SYSIN MEANS A NORMAL ROLL.                *
002000*                                                                *
002100* FILES:                                                         *
002200*   DATECARD  INPUT   MSEC.PROD.CM.DATECARD(0)      FB 80        *
002300*   DATEOUT   OUTPUT  MSEC.PROD.CM.DATECARD(+1)     FB 80        *
002400*   HOLIDAYS  INPUT   MSEC.PROD.CM.HOLIDAYS         FB 40        *
002500*   SYSIN     INPUT   CONTROL CARDS (OPTIONAL)      FB 80        *
002600*   AUDITLOG / CTLTOTS VIA CMU060 / CMU080                       *
002700* CALLS      : CMU010 CMU050 CMU060 CMU080 CMASM02               *
002800* RETURN CODE: 0 NORMAL, 4 WARNING (HOLIDAY FILE NOT LOADED FOR  *
002900*              THE YEAR, DATE MOVED BACKWARDS, BAD CONTROL CARD) *
003000*              U1005 BAD DATE CARD / OVERRIDE NOT A BUSINESS DAY *
003100* RESTART    : RERUN THE JOB FROM THE TOP.  IF THE NEW GENERATION*
003200*              WAS CATALOGED, DELETE DATECARD(0) FIRST OR RERUN  *
003300*              WITH RERUN=Y - SEE OPS RUNBOOK CM-01.             *
