046900* 6000 - SANITY CHECK OF THE HOLIDAY FILE (CHG12001).  OPS MUST  *
047000* LOAD NEXT YEAR'S EXCHANGE CALENDAR BEFORE 12/01.               *
047100*----------------------------------------------------------------*
047200 6000-CHECK-HOLIDAY-FILE.
047300     COMPUTE WS-NEXT-CCYY = WS-NEW-CCYY + 1.
047400     OPEN INPUT HOLIDAY-FILE.
047500     IF WS-HOLIDAY-STATUS NOT = '00'
047600         MOVE '6000-CHECK-HOLIDAY-FILE' TO AB-PARAGRAPH
047700         MOVE 1001               TO AB-ABEND-CODE
047800         MOVE WS-HOLIDAY-STATUS  TO AB-FILE-STATUS
047900         MOVE 'HOLIDAYS'         TO AB-DDNAME
048000         MOVE 'OPEN FAILED ON HOLIDAY CALENDAR' TO AB-MESSAGE
048100         GO TO 9999-ABEND.
048200     MOVE 'N' TO WS-HOL-EOF-SW.
048300     PERFORM 6100-READ-HOLIDAY THRU 6100-EXIT
048400         UNTIL WS-HOL-EOF.
048500     CLOSE HOLIDAY-FILE.
048600     IF WS-HOL-THIS-YEAR = ZERO
048700         DISPLAY 'CMB010 - WARNING - HOLIDAY FILE HAS NO DATES '
048800                 'FOR ' WS-NEW-CCYY
048900         MOVE 4 TO WS-RETURN-CODE
049000         MOVE 'W'   TO AU-SEVERITY
049100         MOVE 'HOLIDAY FILE HAS NO DATES FOR THE CURRENT YEAR'
049200                    TO AU-MESSAGE
