049500         DISPLAY 'CMB010 - WARNING - HOLIDAY FILE NOT YET '
049600                 'LOADED FOR ' WS-NEXT-CCYY
049700         MOVE 4 TO WS-RETURN-CODE
049800         MOVE 'W'   TO AU-SEVERITY
049900         MOVE 'HOLIDAY FILE NOT YET LOADED FOR NEXT YEAR'
050000                    TO AU-MESSAGE
050100         PERFORM 8500-AUDIT-WARNING THRU 8500-EXIT.
050200 6000-EXIT.
050300     EXIT.
